## THREAT MECHANISM TEST
**External risks present:** (1) Macro/tariff uncertainty affecting Colorado facility decision; (2) China supply chain concentration risk (partially mitigated by South Korea partnership); (3) Customer concentration (2 customers >10% of revenue, down from 3).

