## POSITION SIZING RECOMMENDATION
**Recommended maximum position size: 18%**

This is a pre-revenue-scale, single-driver small-cap with a binary technology adoption risk profile. Despite the strong quarter, the company is still burning $7.5M–$9M/quarter in operating cash, relies on ATM equity issuance for liquidity, and has not yet demonstrated sustained multi-quarter gross margin positivity. The thesis is strengthening, but the position cap should reflect the execution risk of a company still in the customer qualification-to-production transition phase. 18% reflects the strengthening thesis and strong mitigation track record while respecting the Type A cap of 35% and the early-stage risk profile. A prior-quarter baseline is unavailable (no prior transcripts), so this is set from first principles.

